Third-party components
----------------------
The source in this repository is first-party. clavity does not bundle Antigravity, Ghidra, or a JDK
— those are supplied by the user at install time. Distributed binary artifacts (the built
installers) statically link or package permissively-licensed third-party dependencies
(MIT / Apache-2.0 / BSD / ISC — e.g. gRPC, Protobuf, the Rust and .NET crate/package ecosystems, and
the Python MCP bridge's runtime dependencies). Those dependencies' own license and attribution
notices accompany the binary distributions in which they ship. No copyleft (GPL / AGPL / LGPL)
dependency is used.
